<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>OSINT on Natan Maia Morette</title><link>https://nmmorette.github.io/tags/osint/</link><description>Recent content in OSINT on Natan Maia Morette</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 11 Dec 2024 00:00:00 -0300</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://nmmorette.github.io/tags/osint/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>OSINT - Básico na prática pt-br</title><link>https://nmmorette.github.io/posts/2024/12/osint-b%C3%A1sico-na-pr%C3%A1tica-pt-br/</link><pubDate>Wed, 11 Dec 2024 00:00:00 -0300</pubDate><guid>https://nmmorette.github.io/posts/2024/12/osint-b%C3%A1sico-na-pr%C3%A1tica-pt-br/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="osint---básico-na-prática"&gt;OSINT - Básico na prática&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="desafio-tryhackme"&gt;Desafio Tryhackme&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;⚠️ Faça cadastro no site Tryhackme para participar do desafio.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://tryhackme.com/signup?referrer=60c8aa07896c88004bd38811" target="_blank"&gt;TryHackMe | Cyber Security Training&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="atalho-ferramentas-úteis"&gt;Atalho Ferramentas úteis&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;⚠️ Confira esta página com diversas ferramentas úteis para OSINT, além de recomendações de livros, cursos e sites.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://start.me/p/BPN26q/osint-naprtica" target="_blank"&gt;OSINT-NaPrática&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="osint"&gt;OSINT&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;img src="https://nmmorette.github.io/images/osintpratica/banner.webp" class="center" style="border-radius: 10px;" /&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;h3 id="o-que-é-osint"&gt;O que é OSINT?&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;OSINT (Open Source Intelligence) é a prática de coletar e analisar informações de fontes públicas e disponíveis para qualquer pessoa. Essas fontes podem incluir:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>OSINT - Desafio OSINT pt-br</title><link>https://nmmorette.github.io/posts/2024/12/osint-desafio-osint-pt-br/</link><pubDate>Wed, 11 Dec 2024 00:00:00 -0300</pubDate><guid>https://nmmorette.github.io/posts/2024/12/osint-desafio-osint-pt-br/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="desafio-osint"&gt;Desafio OSINT&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Esse desafio foi feito para dois eventos em 2024, na GloboSecWeek2024 e também na turma CSSDC24 da ESG.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;O desafio é o mesmo para ambos, porém as Flags são diferentes.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="links-para-o-desafio"&gt;Links para o Desafio&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://tryhackme.com/r/room/osintcssdc2024" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;a href="https://tryhackme.com/r/room/osintcssdc2024"&gt;https://tryhackme.com/r/room/osintcssdc2024&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://tryhackme.com/jr/osintglobosecweek2024" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;a href="https://tryhackme.com/jr/osintglobosecweek2024"&gt;https://tryhackme.com/jr/osintglobosecweek2024&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="task-1-osint--imagem"&gt;Task 1 OSINT -Imagem&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="qual-nome-do-usuário"&gt;Qual nome do usuário?&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Utilize o &lt;a href="https://exif.tools" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;code&gt;exiftool&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;para verificar informações da imagem. Existem diversas versões online disponíveis, além da classfica versão em &lt;code&gt;CLI&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;É possível encontrar um nome de usuário no campo &lt;code&gt;Owner Name&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>OSINT CTF - Menina Cyber Sec and Hack in Cariri</title><link>https://nmmorette.github.io/posts/2024/08/osint-ctf-menina-cyber-sec-and-hack-in-cariri/</link><pubDate>Sat, 10 Aug 2024 00:00:00 -0300</pubDate><guid>https://nmmorette.github.io/posts/2024/08/osint-ctf-menina-cyber-sec-and-hack-in-cariri/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="osint---ctf---mcs"&gt;OSINT - CTF - MCS&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Solutions for the OSINT CTF challenges conducted by Menina de Cyber Sec and Hack in Cariri in August 2024.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h1 id="the-trip-of-my-dreams"&gt;The Trip of My Dreams&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://hackincariri.s3.amazonaws.com/meninadecybersec/osint/desafio+1/OSINT-easy-01.jpeg" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;a href="https://hackincariri.s3.amazonaws.com/meninadecybersec/osint/desafio+1/OSINT-easy-01.jpeg"&gt;https://hackincariri.s3.amazonaws.com/meninadecybersec/osint/desafio+1/OSINT-easy-01.jpeg&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;The trip of my dreams&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;“The photos from the trip turned out amazing!” This is the photo of where we had a snack after a long walk through the city. The flag is the name of the establishment where the cat is coming out of. Example: MCS{PLACE_OF_THE_PHOTO}&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>TryHackme - OhSINT - Write-Up</title><link>https://nmmorette.github.io/posts/2022/08/tryhackme-ohsint-write-up/</link><pubDate>Wed, 24 Aug 2022 00:00:00 -0300</pubDate><guid>https://nmmorette.github.io/posts/2022/08/tryhackme-ohsint-write-up/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="ohsint---tryhackme"&gt;OhSINT - TryHackMe&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;img src="https://nmmorette.github.io/images/OhSINT/Untitled.png" class="center" style="border-radius: 10px;" /&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;What information can you possible get with just one photo?&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;First step is download the file and open it.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;img src="https://nmmorette.github.io/images/OhSINT/Untitled%201.png" class="center" style="border-radius: 10px;" /&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;p&gt;A nostalgic Wallpaper&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Using exiftool to check some attributes:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-jsx" data-lang="jsx"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;exiftool&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;WindowsXP&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;jpg&lt;/span&gt; &#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;ExifTool&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Version&lt;/span&gt; Number &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;12.65&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;File&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Name&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;WindowsXP&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;jpg&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Directory&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; .&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;File&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Size&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;234&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;kB&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;File&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Modification&lt;/span&gt; Date&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Time&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;2023&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;09&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;26&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;18&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;33&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;44&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;04&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;00&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;File&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Access&lt;/span&gt; Date&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Time&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;2023&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;09&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;26&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;18&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;33&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;49&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;04&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;00&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;File&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Inode&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Change&lt;/span&gt; Date&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Time&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;2023&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;09&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;26&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;18&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;33&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;48&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;04&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;00&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;File&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Permissions&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;rwxrw&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;rw&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;File&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Type&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;JPEG&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;File&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Type&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Extension&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;jpg&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;MIME&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Type&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;image&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;jpeg&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;XMP&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Toolkit&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Image&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;::&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;ExifTool&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;11.27&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;GPS&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Latitude&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;54&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;deg&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;17&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39; 41.27&amp;#34; N&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;GPS Longitude : 2 deg 15&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;1.33&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34; W&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;Copyright : OWoodflint&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;Image Width : 1920&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;Image Height : 1080&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;Encoding Process : Baseline DCT, Huffman coding&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;Bits Per Sample : 8&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;Color Components : 3&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;Y Cb Cr Sub Sampling : YCbCr4:2:0 (2 2)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;Image Size : 1920x1080&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;Megapixels : 2.1&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;GPS Latitude Ref : North&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;GPS Longitude Ref : West&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;GPS Position : 54 deg 17&amp;#39; 41.27&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;N&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;deg&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;15&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010"&gt;&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;1.33&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010"&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;W&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Firstly&lt;/strong&gt; in the &lt;code&gt;Copyright&lt;/code&gt; section there’s a name, this could be a person or who owns the right of this photo. Then I Google it: &lt;code&gt;OWoodflint&lt;/code&gt; and found some good results, such as github, twitter and a wordpress blog.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>